cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Beyond-Accuracy: Simulation-Based Safety Evaluation for Decision-Support Classifiers"
abstract: >-
  Companion code that recomputes, from a single fixed seed, the safety-behaviour
  metrics and the deployment verdict reported for the Beyond-Accuracy study. The
  repository contains the reference implementation, a deterministic seed-42
  driver that regenerates every reported metric to committed CSVs, and the
  figure generators.
